l},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-07-15T06:30:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108623","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108623","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108623.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108623.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR optimizes the internal retrieval-by-index methods in `Dictionary`. The changes in this PR were previously part of #104473 which tried to change too much in one PR and ended up in a deadlock.\r\n\r\nThe changes here are:\r\n\r\n1. Optimized `Dictionary.get_key_at_index` and `Dictionary.get_value_at_index` by adding backwards traversal when requested index is in the latter half of `Dictionary`.\r\n\r\n2. Support for negative indices (useful if using -1 to retrieve most recently added key).\r\n\r\n3. Optimizes C# usage of these function which were previously traversing dictionaries twice.\r\n\r\nAlso, I've add more comprehensive unit tests for these functions.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108623/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108623/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}